<p><strong>Classic misdirection.</strong></p>
<p>Before you call me a conspiracy theorist, do some digging for yourself. Do a little digging into why certain wars were fought, why policies are what they are despite the supposed underlying ideology of the party in power. Research monetary and economic policy, the extremes of both sides (Marxism and Fascism), and perhaps even delve into some of the conspiracies of old that ended up being absolute truths.</p>
<p><em>History is written by the victor.</em></p>
